SUMMARY:5 KM/3 mile Sunday Afternoon Walk in Canton
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nThe start/finish point is
  the parking lot for the Rec Park baseball field (not to be confused with 
 the public-school baseball field next to the football stadium—our meetin
 g place is a little further down the road). The field was destroyed by Hur
 ricane Helene\, but the parking area is still there. Hopefully\, some of t
 he Clyde Elementary School Cardinals Elite Walking Team and their families
  will be joining us for this event.\n\nWe will start our walk at the Canto
 n Recreation Park\, go through part of downtown\, up Academy Street\, past
  the historic cemetery and the public library\, past Pisgah High School\, 
 and back to the start point. The up and down are fairly steep.\n\nDress ap
 propriately for the weather. Tennis shoes are fine. This is all pavement\,
  but some might want walking sticks for the up and down\; I plan to walk w
 ith a pair of walking sticks. Bring plenty of water and a protein snack. D
 ogs on leash are welcome.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/314489580/
