SUMMARY:Father's Day Walk of the Western End of Maggie Valley
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nMeet at Maggie Methodist\
 , 4192 Soco Rd.\, Maggie Valley 28751\, in the corner of the parking lot c
 losest to Soco Rd.\, but furthest from the church building. We will meet a
 t 2:00 p.m. There are no restrooms at the start point\, so take care of an
 y needs before you arrive.\n\nThe walk is pretty flat. Tennis shoes are fi
 ne\; walking poles aren't needed. Dress appropriately for the weather. Bri
 ng lots of water and a protein snack. Dogs are welcome. Strollers are fine
 .\n\nWe will walk west on Soco Road to Fie Top\, with one or two side excu
 rsions. We will cross Soco Road and then walk east on the opposite side of
  Soco Road as far as Town Hall. We will cross the road and head west again
 \, finally returning to the Start Point.\n\nSights along the way include M
 ary Rathbone Rich Park\, Tube World\, and Joey's Pancake House.\n\nThis is
  a short\, easy walk\, about 3 miles\, mostly on pavement. Hope to see you
  there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/314489708/
